<%- include('dash-header') %><a class="dash-back" href="/account">← Account settings</a><section class="clear-content"><p class="overline coral-text">A CONTENT RESET</p><h1>A clean slate.<br>The same connections.</h1><p class="heading-description">Clear every memory in <strong><%= brain.name==='default'?'My brain':brain.name %></strong>. Your account, password, and assistant connections stay in place.</p><div class="dash-panel clear-warning"><h2>This clears the content of this brain.</h2><p>Notes, shared facts, handoffs, snapshots, activity, background tasks, conversation history, usage records, and saved workspace files will be removed.</p><p>Other brains are unchanged. Recovery backups may retain previous content until their retention window expires. Download an export first if you want a copy.</p><a class="panel-link" href="/account/export">Export everything ↗</a></div><% if(error) { %><p role="alert" class="message error"><%= error %></p><% } %><form method="post" action="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/clear') %>" class="clear-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label for="clear-confirm">Type CLEAR to reset this brain’s content</label><input id="clear-confirm" name="confirm" pattern="CLEAR" autocomplete="off" required><div class="actions"><button type="submit" class="dash-button coral">Clear brain content</button><a class="dash-button outline" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard') %>">Keep my memories</a></div></form></section><%- include('dash-footer') %>
